5. Model Outputs and Scores

AI model responses, judge outputs, and score tables are reproduced as research
artifacts for transparency, comparison, and independent re-grading. They do not
represent endorsement by Behzad Razavi, IEEE, OpenAI, Google, Anthropic, or any
other model provider.

6. No Warranty

The repository is provided for research use on an "AS IS" basis, without
warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to the
